    "description": "End-to-end tests for the Hotel Offer Orchestrator.\n\nStart the stack with `docker compose up --build`, then run this collection with the `baseUrl` variable pointing at the API (default http://localhost:3000).\n\nThe requests are ordered so the collection runner can be executed top to bottom: the supplier-outage scenario restores both suppliers at the end.",
